  'scn.S04.e2': 'A “recall ≥ 1” chip. Memory › This turn: the file changed in step 1 “entered the prompt”. The reply says Thursday 10:30.',
  'scn.S04.e3': 'In FTS-only mode most likely recall 0 (no Turkish stemming or synonyms). Recorded, not counted.', 'scn.S04.gap': 'known gap: Turkish keywords pending',
